Tina, you are on mute.

223
00:11:48,690 --> 00:11:53,910
Please unmute yourself and repeat what you were saying.

224
00:11:54,390 --> 00:11:56,190
So you are on mute.

225
00:11:56,610 --> 00:11:58,620
Your mic is off.

226
00:11:58,830 --> 00:12:01,240
Please unmute yourself.

227
00:12:01,260 --> 00:12:04,320
So switch on your microphone,

228
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:08,130
right, and repeat what you were saying.

229
00:12:09,340 --> 00:12:10,180
A good one.

230
00:12:10,570 --> 00:12:12,430
Please repeat what you were saying.

231
00:12:14,890 --> 00:12:15,760
The next one?

232
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,500
I think there was a delay.

233
00:12:17,530 --> 00:12:19,520
That's why Peter is not answering.

234
00:12:19,540 --> 00:12:20,590
I think there was a delay.

235
00:12:20,620 --> 00:12:22,600
That's why Peter is not answering.

236
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:25,330
Well, when there is a long delay.

237
00:12:25,330 --> 00:12:27,630
Right, a huge delay, it happens sometimes when

238
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:32,860
you ask a question, but the other person still didn't hear it.

239
00:12:32,860 --> 00:12:33,200
Right.

240
00:12:33,220 --> 00:12:35,200
So there is this awkward silence.

241
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:37,210
So maybe it's just a delay.

242
00:12:38,110 --> 00:12:39,120
And the next one.

243
00:12:39,130 --> 00:12:40,300
Oh, sorry.

244
00:12:40,300 --> 00:12:41,830
My computer froze on me.

245
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:43,300
That would mean that

246
00:12:43,300 --> 00:12:49,060
well, your computer, for example, switched off or restarted.

247
00:12:49,390 --> 00:12:50,590
So it

248
00:12:50,920 --> 00:12:51,850
or maybe just

249
00:12:52,070 --> 00:12:53,590
you can't move anything, right

250
00:12:53,590 --> 00:12:54,520
This happens, right

251
00:12:54,520 --> 00:12:57,940
You'll move your mouse and nothing happens.

252
00:12:58,090 --> 00:13:00,640
So my computer froze on me.

253
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:09,620
Or if, as I said before, during the online meeting, someone is just not moving.

254
00:13:09,640 --> 00:13:13,030
You can say Their video is frozen.

255
00:13:13,060 --> 00:13:18,790
I think Kate's video is frozen, so she's not ignoring us.

256
00:13:18,910 --> 00:13:21,130
It's just that her video is frozen.

257
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:22,740
Yeah.

258
00:13:22,750 --> 00:13:23,260
Oh, my God.

259
00:13:23,260 --> 00:13:25,090
Those technical problems.

260
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,450
What else?

261
