You are breaking up.

262
00:13:27,580 --> 00:13:29,710
I can't make that out.

263
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:32,550
All right, you're breaking up.

264
00:13:33,150 --> 00:13:40,750
Well, you sound like a robot that's breaking up. And I can't make that out

265
00:13:40,830 --> 00:13:44,490
means I cannot understand what you're saying.

266
00:13:44,530 --> 00:13:44,910
Right.

267
00:13:44,910 --> 00:13:47,760
I cannot make that out.

268
00:13:49,750 --> 00:13:50,260
All right.

269
00:13:50,260 --> 00:13:51,430
And one more thing.

270
